Flank Steak Marinade

1 1/2 t instant coffee
1/2 c   water
3 T     balsamic vinegar
3 T     brown sugar
1 T     olive oil
3       cloves garlic, minced
2 t     black pepper
3/4 t   salt

Mix all, marionette steak for several hours.

Broil 6-8 min/side, 4-6 inches below broiler
or grill who knows how much and for how long

From Eating Well, last issue before they 
stopped printing in about 2001 or 2002 or ??

Londa knows

